{title: Zinda Hoon Yaar}
{artist: Amit Trivedi Lootera}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
Mujhe [A#]chhod do mere haal pe,        Mujhe [Gm]chhod do mere haal pe
Zinda hoon [D#]yaar, kaafi [A#]hai!        Zinda hoon [Cm]yaar, kaafi [A#]hai!
[A#]Kaafi hai..        [D#]Kaafi hai...
Ha [D#]waaon se jo maanga hissa me [A#]ra,        To [D#]badle main ha [Gm]wa ne saans [A#]di
A [D#]kelepan se [Gm]chhedi jab gufta [A#]gu,        Mere [Cm]dil ne aawaaz [A#]di
Me [D#]re haathon, hua jo qissa shu [A#]ru,        U [D#]sey poora toh karna hai mu [A#]jhe
Qabr [D#]par mere sar utha ke,        kha [A#]di ho zindagi
[D#]Aise marna hai mu [A#]jhe,        [A#]Kuch Maangna Baaki Nahi
Kuch [Gm]Maangna Baaki Nahi,        Jitna [D#]Mila [A#]Kaafi Hai
Zinda hoon [Cm]yaar, kaafi [A#]hai!        Mujhe [A#]chhod do mere haal pe
Mujhe [Gm]chhod do mere haal pe,        Zinda hoon [D#]yaar kaafi [A#]hai
Zinda hoon [Gm]yaar kaafi [A#]hai,        [A#]Mujhe chhod [D#]do.. o o..
[A#]Mujhe chhod [D#]do.. o o..        [A#]Mere haal pe...
